/F2 20 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 720 Tm (Chapter Four) Tj
/F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 678 Tm (By spring the boy could polish the lens without leaving a streak,) Tj
/F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 661 Tm (and Ada had stopped counting steps altogether. The Kestrel came back) Tj
/F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 644 Tm (with a new green lantern. The town stayed small. The lighthouse, as) Tj
/F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 627 Tm (lighthouses do, kept turning its one bright thought over and over) Tj
/F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 610 Tm (toward the dark.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 60 Tm (Page 4 of 4) Tj
